WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.950
One shift. Four patient stories. Start with a structured note and the follow-ups that still need an owner.

2
00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:09.900
A named colleague. An exact version. Review before sending. Delivery, viewing and acknowledgment stay separate.

3
00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:14.850
Clarify the gap. A question stays with its patient and handoff version.

4
00:00:14.850 --> 00:00:19.800
Review, then acknowledge. Confirm the information actually reviewed. Unanswered questions pause this step.

5
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:24.750
Keep the update visible. v1 keeps its earlier confirmation. v2 presents the added information for a fresh review.

6
00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:29.700
Record the follow-through. Add a factual work result with its author and time, separately from the submitted handoff.

7
00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:35.000
Keep the record. A completion has a traceable result. A correction appends another record.
